  "summary": "My creative journey began in 6th grade with a calligraphy project that sparked a lifelong passion for design. Dubbed a \"Free Spirit\" by my teacher, I embraced thinking outside the box and infusing creativity into every role—from retail management to bar operations and freelancing. Like Dorothy in The Wizard of Oz, my curiosity led me to look behind the curtain, uncovering the code that brings designs to life. This inspired my transition to Full Stack Web Development at V School, where I mastered JavaScript and the MERN stack. Today, I thrive at the intersection of creativity and technology, building solutions that are both functional and visually compelling. As a team player and collaborative problem-solver, I’m driven by the power of teamwork, continuous learning, and creating impactful results together.",
